<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Maharashtra envisions becoming the most preferred and dynamic startup destination in India, with the highest concentration of startups in the country. The policy aspires to create a vibrant, inclusive, and innovation-driven entrepreneurial ecosystem that nurtures startups from ideation to scale. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By fostering a culture of innovation, the state aims to position itself as a global hub for next-generation entrepreneurs. Through this policy, Maharashtra will empower startups across all sectors and regions, with a special focus on future technologies, social impact, sustainability, and inclusive growth.)
/Pg 13 0 R
>>
