/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The state government, in partnership with various regulatory agencies and private entities will grant special support to startups to test new technologies and business models. A sandbox environment will be developed as part of this initiative - a secure, controlled space that allows emerging technologies, products, and services to be tested in compliance with government standards. This will enable startups to validate and refine their innovations under real-world conditions with reduced regulatory risk, fostering responsible experimentation and accelerated deployment.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
