<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To foster grassroots innovation, the government will launch initiatives like Student Innovation Challenge and Startup Yatra, inviting grassroot innovators and early-stage startups to propose their innovative ideas to local challenges identified by the administration. Selected innovators will receive mentorship, incubation access, prototyping facilities, seed funding, cloud resources, and investor networking to help transform ideas into viable ventures.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
