/S /P
/E (To leverage the immense talent of the youth combined with new technologies, there is tremendous scope for finding solutions to problems faced by public as well as private sector. To tackle these challenges, various stakeholders will be encouraged to define problems and organise Hackathons and Grand Challenges. )
